<p>These are, by and large, good fits. The residuals have a well defined pe=
ak centered on zero.&nbsp; DDO 154 was one of the THINGS galaxies; lets see=
 what happens if we use those data.</p>
<figure data-shortcode=3D"caption" id=3D"attachment_7061" aria-describedby=
